This repository contains the experimental software developed for the undergraduate
dissertation "Research and Development of Energy-Efficient Inference Methods for
Generative AI (LLMs) on Low-Power Embedded Systems" (Democritus University of
Thrace, Department of Informatics, Kavala, 2026).

Permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute this software for academic,
research, and educational purposes is granted, provided that this copyright
notice and attribution to the author are retained in all copies or substantial
portions of the software.

The approval of the dissertation by the Department of Informatics, Democritus
University of Thrace, does not necessarily indicate the acceptance of the views
of the author.
